<title>USA: DT Industries completes securities offer.</title>
<headline>DT Industries completes securities offer.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mo. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DT Industries Inc said Friday it completed a $70 million offering of 1.4 million 7.16 percent convertible preferred securities.</p>
<p>The proceeds of the offering are being used to retire indebtedness, it added.</p>
<p>The offering was made through its newly formed DT Capital Trust to a limited number of institutional investors in a private transaction exempt from registration under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
